        Raw <code>**bold**</code> asterisks leak through, code blocks lose syntax colors, AI-generated tables collapse into pipe characters, and local screenshots vanish.
        Here is how rich-text publishing workflows compare in 2026, and how <strong>SoloMD</strong> bridges local plain-text <code>.md</code> files with web publishing platforms in one click.
      </p>

